        <p class="p13" style="margin-top:28.6pt">
          Procedure for handling requests for data deletion
        </p>
        <p class="p6" style="margin-top:12.6pt">
          You may request deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting <a
            href="mailto:support@mysa.io"
